# Tauri regenerates all of this. Its own .gitignore files in there are only
# tracked on the mobile branch, so on a desktop branch nothing stopped a
# `git add .` sweeping up a built .xcarchive. Files already tracked on
# mobile-companion are unaffected, since .gitignore does not apply to those.
